party:pidxProductFamily a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "PIDX product family"@en ;
    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "EPM-DEC-001-0064; EPM-DEC-001-0092"@en ;
    rdfs:domain party:Product ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "The one-letter family of PIDX's downstream product codes that the product's PIDX codes belong to. A plain identifier: PIDX publishes no IRIs, and a PIDX code names one company's traded grade, so the product is not mapped to PIDX codes."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Source: PIDX Downstream Product Codes, document 04-101-15-45-2010, file PIDX_ProductCodes_10_20_2026.xlsx from https://pidx.org/standards/ (retrieved 2026-10-23). Its Families sheet is dated 2015-09-29, and PIDX's notice of 2024-07-31 changed family S, so the letters are to be confirmed with PIDX (ontology/business-closeout.md, point 5). © PIDX, Inc. 2023. Use of this copyrighted material is subject to the PIDX End User License Agreement available at www.pidx.org/license."@en .

